# Code Comment Gate (always on)

After creating or updating any source file, read and follow `.cursor/skills/code-comment-gate/SKILL.md` before the final reply.

1. Audit changed source files for sufficient comments (why / invariants / exports / quirks — not narration).
2. If insufficient → **add comments in the files now**.
3. Do not finish the turn with only a chat note about missing comments.
4. Do **not** auto git-commit; “add comment” ≠ git commit unless the user explicitly asks to commit.
